<li>George Welch (U.S. Army Fighter Corp Pilot) &amp; Kenneth Taylor (U.S. Army Corp Second Lieutenant Pilot)</li>
<li>John Finn (U.S. Navy Chief Petty Officer)</li>
<li>George Walters (Civilian dockyard worker)</li>
<li>Edwin Hill (U.S. Navy Sailor)</li>
<li>Phil Rasmussen (U.S. Army Air Corp Second Lieutenant)</li>
</ul>';
